# Files that are not part of the Codex plugin surface. Codex loads the plugin
# with a ~32 KiB host-context budget, so keeping build output, CI config,
# contributor metadata, and other hosts' packaging out of the bundle leaves the
# budget for the protocol itself (AGENTS.md, SKILL.md, reference.md, fragments/).

# Build output and dependencies
dist/
node_modules/

# CI and repository automation
.github/

# Contributor and release metadata
.all-contributorsrc
CHANGELOG.md
CITATION.cff
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CREDITS.md
RELEASE.md

# Other hosts' packaging and entry points
.claude/
.claude-plugin/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.antigravity-plugin/
gemini-extension.json
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
